+- Exchange rangepartitioning(s_suppkey#18 ASC NULLS FIRST)
   +- Project [s_suppkey#18, s_name#19, s_address#20, s_phone#22, total_revenue#26]
      +- HashJoin Inner, [s_suppkey#18] = [supplier_no#25], RuntimeFilter #1: s_suppkey#18 -> spark_catalog.default.supplier.s_suppkey
         :- Scan spark_catalog.default.supplier [s_suppkey#18, s_name#19, s_address#20, s_phone#22]
         +- BroadcastExchange
            +- Filter (total_revenue#26 == scalar-subquery)
               :- Project revenue [supplier_no#25, total_revenue#26]
               :  +- HashAggregate keys=[l_suppkey#2], functions=[sum((l_extendedprice#5 * (1 - l_discount#6)))]
